<Slide style={{ padding: '60px 60px', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>关键机制：确认权始终在人</Text>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB', marginTop: 16, marginBottom: 34 }} />
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#F1F5F9', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 16px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 20, background: '#64748B', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>1</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#334155', marginTop: 12 }}>人写</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 8, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>写节点 + 连关系边</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#94A3B8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>→</Text>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#F1F5F9', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 16px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 20, background: '#64748B', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>2</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#334155', marginTop: 12 }}>固化</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 8, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>固化产生版本快照</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#94A3B8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>→</Text>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 16px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 20, background: '#2563EB', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>3</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A', marginTop: 12 }}>提问</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', marginTop: 8, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>对话输入·意图分流</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#94A3B8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>→</Text>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 16px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 20, background: '#2563EB', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>4</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A', marginTop: 12 }}>AI 查</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', marginTop: 8, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>至多 3 职责并行</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#94A3B8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>→</Text>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FEF3C7', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 16px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 20, background: '#F59E0B', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>5</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#92400E', marginTop: 12 }}>人确认</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#78350F', marginTop: 8, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>预览后确认/拒绝</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', background: '#1E3A8A', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 24px', marginTop: 30 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>智能体的提议一律先变「待确认」候选卡，人预览确认后才生效</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#BFDBFE', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>写节点只改草稿、不产生版本；先固化，再问下一步，候选才对得上当前版本。</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
